3">design</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.233" end="01:32.204"><span begin="01:29.233" end="01:29.529">The </span><span begin="01:29.529" end="01:29.962">sun </span><span begin="01:29.962" end="01:30.526">through </span><span begin="01:30.526" end="01:30.909">the </span><span begin="01:30.909" end="01:32.204">curtains</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.579" end="01:35.617"><span begin="01:32.579" end="01:32.877">The </span><span begin="01:32.877" end="01:33.922">coffee </span><span begin="01:33.922" end="01:34.282">still </span><span begin="01:34.282" end="01:35.617">burnin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.203" end="01:42.510"><span begin="01:36.203" end="01:36.493">As </span><span begin="01:36.493" end="01:36.877">we </span><span begin="01:36.877" end="01:37.481">sway </span><span begin="01:37.481" end="01:37.911">from </span><span begin="01:37.911" end="01:39.679">side </span><span begin="01:39.679" end="01:41.476">to </span><span begin="01:41.476" end="01:42.510">side</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.299" end="01:46.353"><span begin="01:43.299" end="01:43.757">Or </span><span begin="01:43.757" end="01:44.317">hand </span><span begin="01:44.317" end="01:44.820">in </span><span begin="01:44.820" end="01:46.353">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.820" end="01:50.991"><span begin="01:47.820" end="01:48.204">Walking </span><span begin="01:48.204" end="01:48.859">through </span><span begin="01:48.859" end="01:49.164">a </span><span begin="01:49.164" end="01:49.618">field </span><span begin="01:49.618" end="01:49.907">of </span><span begin="01:49.907" end="01:50.991">daisies</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.991" end="01:53.352"><span begin="01:50.991" end="01:51.285">From </span><span begin="01:51.285" end="01:51.550">a </span><span begin="01:51.550" end="01:52.127">distant </span><span begin="01:52.127" end="01:53.352">land</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.675" end="01:59.527"><span begin="01:56.675" end="01:56